{"verse_key": "10:83", "surah": 10, "verse": 83, "text_uthmani": "فَمَآ ءَامَنَ لِمُوسَىٰٓ إِلَّا ذُرِّيَّةٌ مِّن قَوْمِهِۦ عَلَىٰ خَوْفٍ مِّن فِرْعَوْنَ وَمَلَإِي۟هِمْ أَن يَفْتِنَهُمْ ۚ وَإِنَّ فِرْعَوْنَ لَعَالٍ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَإِنَّهُۥ لَمِنَ ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ", "translation": "But no one believed Moses, except [some] offspring [i.e., youths] among his people, for fear of Pharaoh and his establishment that they would persecute them. And indeed, Pharaoh was haughty within the land, and indeed, he was of the transgressors.", "verse_from_ms": 1814420, "verse_to_ms": 1841540, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "فَمَآ", "start_ms": 1814420, "end_ms": 1816580}, {"i": 1, "text": "ءَامَنَ", "start_ms": 1816580, "end_ms": 1817380}, {"i": 2, "text": "لِمُوسَىٰٓ", "start_ms": 1817380, "end_ms": 1819640}, {"i": 3, "text": "إِلَّا", "start_ms": 1819640, "end_ms": 1820400}, {"i": 4, "text": "ذُرِّيَّةٌ", "start_ms": 1820400, "end_ms": 1821700}, {"i": 5, "text": "مِّن", "start_ms": 1821700, "end_ms": 1823150}, {"i": 6, "text": "قَوْمِهِۦ", "start_ms": 1823150, "end_ms": 1823990}, {"i": 7, "text": "عَلَىٰ", "start_ms": 1823990, "end_ms": 1824580}, {"i": 8, "text": "خَوْفٍ", "start_ms": 1824580, "end_ms": 1825450}, {"i": 9, "text": "مِّن", "start_ms": 1825450, "end_ms": 1826570}, {"i": 10, "text": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "start_ms": 1826570, "end_ms": 1827550}, {"i": 11, "text": "وَمَلَإِي۟هِمْ", "start_ms": 1827550, "end_ms": 1828740}, {"i": 12, "text": "أَن", "start_ms": 1828740, "end_ms": 1829340}, {"i": 13, "text": "يَفْتِنَهُمْ", "start_ms": 1829340, "end_ms": 1831420}, {"i": 14, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 1831420, "end_ms": 1832670}, {"i": 15, "text": "وَإِنَّ", "start_ms": 1832670, "end_ms": 1833740}, {"i": 16, "text": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "start_ms": 1833740, "end_ms": 1835150}, {"i": 17, "text": "لَعَالٍ", "start_ms": 1835150, "end_ms": 1835440}, {"i": 18, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 1835440, "end_ms": 1836180}, {